# Shelter Atoll's lagoon cave and Dr. Shogo (CIPlay shelter_atoll_cave, 11-04; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in
# its recipe. The storeroom is barred until someone talked to Dr. Shogo; the cave's supply chest stays hidden until his
# second answer (CITalk "Shelter Atoll" "Dr. Shogo" pick 2 after this play: the island is kept); the den has air and a
# dry way down to the water. Pictures of Dr. Shogo, the storeroom, the dinghy by the mouth and the den.
island Shelter Atoll keep
offset 14.7199 -1.3105
hour 11
weather Calm
expect hidden shelsupply

# The storeroom off the radio room: barred
at 6 0 h=1.9
use storedoor stay
expect message barred from inside
expect shown storedoor

# Dr. Shogo at the channel, sitting on his chair
picture sa_shogo -13.5 2.2 57.2 -16 0.9 55
snap sa_shogo_chair shogochair 250 3 1
use signe
expect step 0

# Now the bar lifts
at 6 0 h=1.9
use storedoor stay
expect message lift the bar
expect hidden storedoor
picture sa_storeroom 6 3.3 0.6 6 2.2 7

# The dinghy by the cave's mouth on the lagoon floor, from the landing
picture sa_cave_landing 2 4 -12 -5 -3 -22
snap sa_dinghy dinghy 30 5 2

# The den: dry, air, and a dry way down the tunnel to the water
walk -23.6 -64 to -19 -54.3 to -15.5 -46.5 below=7
picture sa_den_in -19 3.5 -54 -26 3 -68
picture sa_den_out -26 3.5 -68 -15 1.5 -47
air shelair
picture sa_den_outside -45 12 -45 -24 4 -64
